---
module: hubspot
func_id: map-contact
---

***conformance tests***

# map-full-contact
:HubSpotContactMapping: maps a `ContactRecord` of :HubSpotRestAPI: with `id` `501` and `properties` `firstname` `Ada`, `lastname` `Lovelace`, `email` ` Ada@Example.COM `, `jobtitle` `Engineer` and `company` `Analytical Engines` to a :Contact:.
- `provider_id` is `hubspot`, `external_id` is `501`, `full_name` is `Ada Lovelace`.
- `primary_email` is `ada@example.com`, `job_title` is `Engineer`, `company_name` is `Analytical Engines`.
- `custom_fields` is `{}`.

# name-from-one-part
:HubSpotContactMapping: maps a `ContactRecord` of :HubSpotRestAPI: with `firstname` `Ada` and a `null` `lastname` to a :Contact:.
- `full_name` is `Ada`.

# map-empty-properties
:HubSpotContactMapping: maps a `ContactRecord` of :HubSpotRestAPI: with `id` `502` and every property `null` to a :Contact:.
- `full_name` is `""`.
- `primary_email`, `job_title` and `company_name` are `null`.
- `custom_fields` is `{}`.

***acceptance tests***
